ev:book-1:L030:odd-by-definition:001","sourceId":"L030","sourceSha256":"e2810b21f37336ccfa655208769f7d0c94473088a20b230aa36e19287362daa3","locator":{"headingPath":["用定义证明奇函数并核定义域对称"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":null,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":8,"pdfPage":null,"printedPage":8,"equationObjectId":null,"renderVariant":"cjk-process-font-substitution"},"quote":"y=x^3-\\frac1x","sourceSupportedTranscription":"分析 首先求出函数定义域．由于此函数不便于画出函数图像，直接用符号语言的定义来证明即可．证明 函数$y=x^3-\\frac1x$的定义域为$D=\\{x\\mid x\\ne0,x\\in\\mathbf R\\}$．记$f(x)=x^3-\\frac1x$．在$D$中任取一个实数$x$，都有$-x\\ne0$，因此$-x\\in D$，并且$f(-x)=(-x)^3-\\frac1{-x}=-\\left(x^3-\\frac1x\\right)=-f(x)$．因此，$y=x^3-\\frac1x$是一个奇函数．","wordingChecked":false,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L030","requestedPath":"increments/batch05-v1/evidence-cjk/L030/page-8.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L030.docx","sourceTitle":"5.2函数的基本性质（1）-教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"},{"id":"ev:book-2:L107:parity-counterexample-b0","sourceId":"L107","sourceSha256":"8fa41022e173e700d164542ec738f03f48ab57739a4ed54c338c94883acfa9f7","locator":{"headingPath":["L107","用一对相反自变量排除奇偶性"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":82,"paragraphIndexConvention":"1-based all .//w:p document order","tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":4,"pdfPage":4,"printedPage":null,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"思考 对函数$y=2\\sin\\left(\\frac x2+\\frac\\pi6\\right)$，还能研究些什么？","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L107","requestedPath":"increments/l107-v2/evidence/L107-cjk/page-4.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L107.docx","sourceTitle":"三角函数复习课 教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"},{"id":"e